{% comment %}
  ATRAMENTI TRUST BAR  ·  Forest & Amber

  The one marquee on the page (Section 5 caps it at one). Motivated: it
  carries seven short trust signals that would otherwise need a whole
  section, and none of them deserves individual attention.

  Changed:
  - Removed "Jetzt · 23 kreieren gerade". A live counter with no live data
    behind it is fabricated social proof.
  - Dingbats (the geometric glyph set) replaced with Phosphor icons.
  - Middle-dot separators replaced with hairlines.
  - role="marquee" is not a real ARIA role. The duplicate track needed for
    the seamless loop is now aria-hidden so it is not announced twice.
  - Under prefers-reduced-motion the track stops and becomes a normal
    horizontally scrollable row.
{% endcomment %}

<div class="atm atm-trust">
  <div class="atm-trust-viewport">
    <div class="atm-trust-track">
      {%- for pass in (1..2) -%}
        <ul class="atm-trust-set"{% if pass == 2 %} aria-hidden="true"{% endif %}>
          <li class="atm-trust-item">
            <span class="atm-trust-icon">{% render 'atm-icon', name: 'star-fill' %}</span>
            4,9 von 5 bei über 10.000 Bewertungen
          </li>
          <li class="atm-trust-item">
            <span class="atm-trust-icon">{% render 'atm-icon', name: 'truck' %}</span>
            48h Lieferung
          </li>
          <li class="atm-trust-item">
            <span class="atm-trust-icon">{% render 'atm-icon', name: 'leaf' %}</span>
            CO<sub>2</sub>-neutral verpackt
          </li>
          <li class="atm-trust-item">
            <span class="atm-trust-icon">{% render 'atm-icon', name: 'flask' %}</span>
            28 Nischen-Essenzen
          </li>
          <li class="atm-trust-item">
            <span class="atm-trust-icon">{% render 'atm-icon', name: 'arrow-counter-clockwise' %}</span>
            Kostenloser Rückversand
          </li>
          <li class="atm-trust-item">
            <span class="atm-trust-icon">{% render 'atm-icon', name: 'recycle' %}</span>
            Plastikfreie Verpackung
          </li>
          <li class="atm-trust-item">
            <span class="atm-trust-icon">{% render 'atm-icon', name: 'drop' %}</span>
            Wiederbefüllbare Flakons
          </li>
        </ul>
      {%- endfor -%}
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<style>
  .atm-trust {
    background: var(--atm-bg-2);
    border-block: 1px solid var(--atm-line);
  }

  .atm-trust-viewport {
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  /* Fade the edges into the bar background so items do not pop in. */
  .atm-trust-viewport::before,
  .atm-trust-viewport::after {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    bottom: 0;
    width: clamp(28px, 7vw, 96px);
    z-index: 2;
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .atm-trust-viewport::before {
    left: 0;
    background: linear-gradient(to right, var(--atm-bg-2), transparent);
  }

  .atm-trust-viewport::after {
    right: 0;
    background: linear-gradient(to left, var(--atm-bg-2), transparent);
  }

  .atm-trust-track {
    display: flex;
    width: max-content;
    animation: atm-trust-scroll 46s linear infinite;
  }

  .atm-trust-viewport:hover .atm-trust-track,
  .atm-trust-viewport:focus-within .atm-trust-track {
    animation-play-state: paused;
  }

  @keyframes atm-trust-scroll {
    from {
      transform: translate3d(0, 0, 0);
    }
    to {
      transform: translate3d(-50%, 0, 0);
    }
  }

  .atm-trust-set {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
  }

  .atm-trust-item {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
    padding: 15px clamp(20px, 3vw, 38px);
    white-space: nowrap;
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--atm-ink-dim);
    border-right: 1px solid var(--atm-line);
  }

  .atm-trust-icon {
    display: flex;
    font-size: 17px;
    color: var(--atm-accent);
  }

  .atm-trust-item sub {
    font-size: 0.75em;
    vertical-align: baseline;
  }

  /* Static, scrollable, duplicate hidden. */
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .atm-trust-viewport {
      overflow-x: auto;
      scrollbar-width: thin;
    }

    .atm-trust-track {
      animation: none;
    }

    .atm-trust-set[aria-hidden='true'] {
      display: none;
    }
  }
</style>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Atramenti - Trust Bar",
  "tag": "div",
  "class": "atm-trust-section",
  "settings": [],
  "presets": [
    {
      "name": "Atramenti - Trust Bar"
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
